WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.618 --> 00:00:01.471
- What?!

00:00:01.471 --> 00:00:05.338
Like seriously, like the
people that are good at yoga,

00:00:05.338 --> 00:00:06.775
God bless you.

00:00:06.775 --> 00:00:09.597
(mystical music)

00:00:09.597 --> 00:00:12.237
- My name is Paula Gelbart,
I'm a physical therapist,

00:00:12.237 --> 00:00:13.677
and a yoga teacher.

00:00:15.702 --> 00:00:18.473
- I normally teach
adults, and yoga teachers.

00:00:19.850 --> 00:00:21.650
- I think it's gonna go well today.

00:00:21.650 --> 00:00:22.483
(children groaning in pain)

00:00:22.483 --> 00:00:23.316
And then smile.

00:00:23.316 --> 00:00:24.562
- I cannot smile.

00:00:25.982 --> 00:00:27.652
- No, never in my life.

00:00:27.652 --> 00:00:30.482
- Not like hardcore, like yoga-yoga.

00:00:30.482 --> 00:00:32.099
- [Paula] Like...
- [Boy] Like mom yoga.

00:00:32.099 --> 00:00:32.865
- Mom yoga.

00:00:32.865 --> 00:00:36.344
- But I've done like handstands
and stuff, and conditioning.

00:00:36.344 --> 00:00:38.764
- I think it'll like make me feel free.

00:00:38.764 --> 00:00:40.031
(girl hums)

00:00:41.818 --> 00:00:43.981
- Oh yeah!

00:00:43.981 --> 00:00:46.124
Booyah, bing bing bing!

00:00:46.124 --> 00:00:48.127
- So we start with our feet together

00:00:48.127 --> 00:00:49.187
at the front of the mat.

00:00:49.187 --> 00:00:51.528
Now lift your arms up overhead.

00:00:51.528 --> 00:00:53.758
Raise your arms up high,

00:00:53.758 --> 00:00:57.228
and then fold forward all the way down.

00:00:57.228 --> 00:00:58.973
Try to touch your toes.

00:00:58.973 --> 00:01:00.790
And step into plank.

00:01:00.790 --> 00:01:01.603
Can you do this?

00:01:01.603 --> 00:01:04.052
Push yourself up and back, good.

00:01:04.052 --> 00:01:05.173
- [Boy in red] Ow!
- [Boy in blue] Good?

00:01:05.173 --> 00:01:07.656
This is like not relaxing at all.

00:01:07.656 --> 00:01:09.956
- [Paula] Now we're in down dog.

00:01:09.956 --> 00:01:10.758
- [Boy] I'm okay.

00:01:15.346 --> 00:01:16.936
- [Paula] Shake your tails.

00:01:16.936 --> 00:01:18.899
Shake your tail.
- [Boy] Woo yeah!

00:01:18.899 --> 00:01:19.867
- Yeah.

00:01:19.867 --> 00:01:22.097
And step your feet forward.

00:01:22.097 --> 00:01:24.487
And reach up, take your hands up.

00:01:24.487 --> 00:01:26.957
Take your hands down into your heart.

00:01:26.957 --> 00:01:28.677
That was a sun salutation.

00:01:28.677 --> 00:01:30.287
Sun salutation A.

00:01:30.287 --> 00:01:31.457
- [Boy] That's a new one!

00:01:31.457 --> 00:01:33.947
- Really like, warming up my body and ah!

00:01:33.947 --> 00:01:35.507
- Like you're going up to heaven.

00:01:35.507 --> 00:01:36.880
- And like it's a new one for me

00:01:36.880 --> 00:01:38.766
and my mom after the treadmill so...

00:01:38.766 --> 00:01:41.277
- If you hold your nose
while standing on one foot

00:01:41.277 --> 00:01:42.877
it makes you balance better.

00:01:42.877 --> 00:01:44.857
- Alright now, stand
with your feet together,

00:01:44.857 --> 00:01:47.617
and bend your right knee out to the side.

00:01:47.617 --> 00:01:48.880
Other leg.

00:01:48.880 --> 00:01:50.910
Grab your right foot.

00:01:50.910 --> 00:01:53.159
Put your right foot on your left thigh.

00:01:54.600 --> 00:01:55.573
- Um...

00:01:55.573 --> 00:01:59.473
- Reach your arms up and grow your tree.

00:02:00.343 --> 00:02:02.253
You're gonna fall, uh oh!

00:02:05.911 --> 00:02:07.382
- My tree sways a lot.

00:02:07.382 --> 00:02:09.282
- [Paula] Yeah there's a lot
of wind over there, right?

00:02:10.801 --> 00:02:14.002
- Yeah well, as long as we don't get cut.

00:02:14.002 --> 00:02:15.702
- Trees have a hard life I guess.

00:02:15.702 --> 00:02:18.942
- One thing, those people
that are good at yoga,

00:02:18.942 --> 00:02:20.272
don't wear jeans.

00:02:20.272 --> 00:02:22.782
And I'm learning that the
hard way, let me tell ya.

00:02:22.782 --> 00:02:24.792
- Yoga was really fun and hard.

00:02:24.792 --> 00:02:26.162
I'm upside down and I'm like,

00:02:26.162 --> 00:02:28.672
"Whoa, feels like I'm
in another dimension."

00:02:28.672 --> 00:02:31.083
- I think it was challenging, too.

00:02:31.083 --> 00:02:32.602
Definitely the pretzel.

00:02:32.602 --> 00:02:34.522
I would give you a warning not to do this

00:02:34.522 --> 00:02:35.863
unless you really wanna feel like

00:02:35.863 --> 00:02:37.302
your foot's coming off your body.

00:02:37.302 --> 00:02:41.022
- I wish I had some words,
but I have an expression.

00:02:41.022 --> 00:02:42.846
- Yoga is pretty much conditioning,

00:02:42.846 --> 00:02:47.846
and it like get's you
encouraged to be more flexible.

00:02:47.909 --> 00:02:50.269
- Every second is like mayhem.

00:02:50.269 --> 00:02:52.909
So like seriously,

00:02:52.909 --> 00:02:55.324
like God bless those people,

00:02:55.324 --> 00:02:59.584
like you and like Kaylee
who are good at this

00:02:59.584 --> 00:03:01.045
so called "sport."

00:03:01.045 --> 00:03:02.813
- Toby, would you work with me again?

00:03:02.813 --> 00:03:04.943
- Yeah, I thought you were really good!

00:03:04.943 --> 00:03:06.533
You're like, like really good.

00:03:06.533 --> 00:03:08.293
She said, "Never give up."

00:03:08.293 --> 00:03:10.354
And I like that when I
got it, she said, "Great."

00:03:10.354 --> 00:03:12.133
When I didn't, she said, "Try again."

00:03:12.133 --> 00:03:15.113
And you know what, that's what
a great teacher does so...

00:03:15.113 --> 00:03:18.133
- I learned that kids are unstoppable.

00:03:18.133 --> 00:03:19.304
Do you want me to spot you?

00:03:19.304 --> 00:03:20.501
- No, I can do it?

00:03:20.501 --> 00:03:21.894
- [Paula] You can do it?
- [Voiceover] She's got it.

00:03:21.894 --> 00:03:23.163
Oh, Jesus.

00:03:23.163 --> 00:03:23.880
- Can you bend your knees

00:03:23.880 --> 00:03:25.538
and touch your head with your feet?

00:03:25.538 --> 00:03:27.271
- [Voiceover] Yeah!

00:03:27.271 --> 00:03:29.506
- [Paula] Good job!

00:03:29.506 --> 00:03:30.897
- [Voiceover] Can you do that?

00:03:30.897 --> 00:03:32.700
- No, I can't do that.

